#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only alarms currently shown in the alarm list can be selected for searching. So if you want to search archived alarms, you must first display them as described in the section above."
msgstr "Só se poden seleccionar para as pesquisas as alarmas que se amosen actualmente na lista de alarmas. Polo tanto, para buscar nas alarmas arquivadas hainas que amosar primeiro tal e como se describe na sección anterior."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating and Manipulating Alarms"
msgstr "Crear e manipular alarmas"

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a New Alarm"
msgstr "Crear unha alarma nova"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "To create a new alarm, do one of the following, and then select the type of alarm from the list which appears. This displays the <link linkend=\"alarm-edit-dlg\">Alarm Edit dialog</link> through which you configure the alarm."
