#| msgid "The three alarm entity types &ndash; active alarms, archived alarms and alarm templates &ndash; are stored in separate alarm resources. &kalarm; therefore has three standard default resources, one for each type (see <link linkend=\"faq\">Questions and Answers</link> for details), which you can change if you wish."
