#| msgid "If in the unlikely event that any alarm was not triggered when it should have been, you can refresh the alarm list and trigger any missed alarms by selecting <menuchoice> <guimenu>Actions</guimenu><guimenuitem>Refresh Alarms</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. This causes &kalarm; to reload all alarm calendar files and resources."
