#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:3077
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Position windows far from mouse cursor</guilabel>: Select this option to display alarm message windows as far away from the current mouse cursor position as possible. This minimizes the chance of accidentally acknowledging an alarm by unintentionally clicking on a button just as the message window appears."
